          <span class="vtag">A-Frame</span><span class="vtag">WebXR</span><span class="vtag">Spatial</span><span class="vtag">Meta Quest</span>
        </div>
        <a class="role-apply" href="mailto:careers@kodek.in">Apply → careers@kodek.in</a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="careers-cta fade-up">
      <div>
        <div class="careers-cta-title">Don't see your role?</div>
        <div class="careers-cta-text">We're always open to exceptional people. Send your work and tell us what you'd build at Kodek.</div>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:careers@kodek.in" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Write to us →</a>
    </div>
